usage: sfx_detect_probe [-h] [--page PAGE] [--weights WEIGHTS] [--out OUT]
                        [--label LABEL]

One-shot frozen-process SFX detect probe (M2-PROD-SFX-PROBE-1): one production
SfxDetectionProvider.detect against the in-bundle v2b weights, audit JSON on
stdout.

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --page PAGE        inject a real page (png/jpg) instead of the builtin
                     synthetic page
  --weights WEIGHTS  explicit weights path (else NEWMANGA_SFX_WEIGHTS, else
                     the frozen in-bundle probe)
  --out OUT          also write the probe JSON pretty-printed to this path
  --label LABEL      free-form label for the outer runner (e.g. synthetic |
                     injected-real-page)

